      <p begin="01:23.652" end="01:25.622" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ayy, ayy, ayy, ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:25.622" end="01:28.053" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, ayy, hide my face, I don't feel nothin'</p>
      <p begin="01:28.053" end="01:30.740" ttm:agent="v1">One-fifty for the skelly, kept it plain</p>
      <p begin="01:30.740" end="01:33.477" ttm:agent="v1">I did it so bad, sittin' in the rain</p>
